    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d842">

                <pb facs="0801" n="795" sameAs="frus:frus1939v04/pg795"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.55/191</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 3171</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-08-05">August 5, 1939</date>.<lb/>[Received August
                        15.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report, in continuation
                    of my despatch No. 3037 of July 15, 1939<anchor n="12" xml:id="d842-f1"/> on the
                    suspension of immigration into <pb facs="0802" n="796" xml:id="pg796"/>
                    Palestine, that the Colonial Secretary (Mr. Malcolm MacDonald) stated in the
                    House of Commons on August 2 that the Government could not reconsider its
                    previously announced decision in this matter and that the prohibition on
                    immigration into Palestine for the six months’ period beginning October 1, 1939
                    would extend to refugee children and dependent parents.</p>
                <p>An excerpt from Hansard giving the full text of Mr. MacDonald’s statements,
                    together with the questions to which they were a reply, is enclosed.<anchor
                        n="13" xml:id="d842-f2"/></p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herschel V.
                    Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
